5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,We need to verify if the staffing model is actually viable before we commit.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I want to check the history. We keep repeating mistakes from eight years ago.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I am looking for the hidden dependencies. Who else has to sign off on this?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I am worried about the long-term costs. The headline numbers hide the future burden.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to see where the time actually goes. Complaints are often misleading.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, do you think the committee minutes will show if we have the authority?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"I will look at the pilots. If they failed, we should know why.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, yes. The minutes might reveal if the ferry and rail are aligned.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I will check the ledger. I need to see what is ring-fenced versus what is available.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Sakura,,I will look at the journey audits. I suspect the waiting time is the real issue.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will also check the roster books. I need to know if the late-turn pool is empty.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I will also look at the completion records. Did the accessibility work actually finish?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will check the contingency pricing. I suspect the pre-war shells are hiding problems.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will also look at the ticketing fees. I want to see if the contractors are eating the budget.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I will also check the timed runs. I want to compare the current speed with the old data.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Victoria,,Let's see what we find. I am not comfortable promising dates without knowing the crew status.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Takumi,,Agreed. I will read the closure reports before we get excited about anything.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I will assess the ground conditions. I do not trust the drawings alone.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I will try to understand the financial commitment. It is hard to speak up, but I am worried.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I will solve this mystery. I bet the stopwatch tells a different story than the complaints.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
