74,3,3,talk,Sakura,,I am voting for Option C. It solves the waiting time problem and has a good track record.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Victoria,,It seems we are all aligned on Option C.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Takumi,,Yes. The evidence supports it.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
